    {
      "subject": "Ivan",
      "relation": "BROTHER_OF",
      "object": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch",
      "quote": "By the way, let us say a word or two of Ivan’s feeling to his brother Dmitri.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 75,
      "doc_id": "ch075",
      "label_ko": "11편 6장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Katerina Ivanovna",
      "relation": "LOVES",
      "object": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch",
      "quote": "Ivan looked with indignation on Katerina Ivanovna’s love for his brother.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 75,
      "doc_id": "ch075",
      "label_ko": "11편 6장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch",
      "relation": "QUARRELS_WITH",
      "object": "Ivan",
      "quote": "He even succeeded in insulting Ivan during their first interview, telling him sharply that it was not for people who declared that “everything was lawful,” to suspect and question him.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 75,
      "doc_id": "ch075",
      "label_ko": "11편 6장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Smerdyakov",
      "relation": "ACCUSED_OF",
      "object": "the murder",
      "quote": "he refused to entertain a suspicion against Mitya, and spoke openly of Smerdyakov as the murderer.",
      "disputed": true,
      "first_revealed_index": 75,
      "doc_id": "ch075",
      "label_ko": "11편 6장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch",
      "relation": "ACCUSED_OF",
      "object": "the murder",
      "quote": "hearing the details of the charge and the arrest, he was still more surprised at Alyosha, and ascribed his opinion only to his exaggerated brotherly feeling and sympathy with Mitya",
      "disputed": true,
      "first_revealed_index": 75,
      "doc_id": "ch075",
      "label_ko": "11편 6장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Smerdyakov",
      "relation": "LIVES_AT",
      "object": "hospital",
      "quote": "He put that off till he had seen Smerdyakov, who was at that time in the hospital.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 75,
      "doc_id": "ch075",
      "label_ko": "11편 6장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Ivan",
      "relation": "QUARRELS_WITH",
      "object": "Smerdyakov",
      "quote": "“You are cunning with me, damn you!” he exclaimed, getting angry.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 75,
      "doc_id": "ch075",
      "label_ko": "11편 6장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov",
      "relation": "FATHER_OF",
      "object": "Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "quote": "foreseeing such a calamity you deserted your own father, and would not protect us",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 75,
      "doc_id": "ch075",
      "label_ko": "11편 6장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "relation": "BROTHER_OF",
      "object": "Alexei Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "quote": "Alyosha turned rather pale, and looked silently into his brother’s face.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 75,
      "doc_id": "ch075",
      "label_ko": "11편 6장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "relation": "BROTHER_OF",
      "object": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "quote": "My brother directly accuses you of the murder and theft.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 75,
      "doc_id": "ch075",
      "label_ko": "11편 6장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "relation": "LOVES",
      "object": "Katerina Ivanovna",
      "quote": "he abandoned himself hopelessly to his mad and consuming passion for Katerina Ivanovna.",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 75,
      "doc_id": "ch075",
      "label_ko": "11편 6장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Katerina Ivanovna",
      "relation": "LOVES",
      "object": "Ivan Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "quote": "the sternly virtuous girl did not abandon herself altogether to the man she loved",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 75,
      "doc_id": "ch075",
      "label_ko": "11편 6장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "relation": "QUARRELS_WITH",
      "object": "Fyodor Pavlovitch Karamazov",
      "quote": "Do you remember when Dmitri burst in after dinner and beat father, and afterwards I told you in the yard that I reserved ‘the right to desire’?",
      "disputed": false,
      "first_revealed_index": 75,
