      "label_ko": "11편 6장"
    },
    {
      "subject": "Dmitri Fyodorovitch Karamazov",
      "relation": "ACCUSED_OF",
      "object": "murder of Fyodor Pavlovitch",
      "quote": "In the following days he became convinced of Mitya’s guilt, as he got to know all the weight of evidence against him.",
